repository-code: https://github.com/Tripp5118/resource-allocation

abstract: >-
  Code and experiment configuration for a study of how a large language model
  allocates a fixed experimental budget between exploration and exploitation
  inside a multi-objective Bayesian optimization loop, evaluated on two
  high-entropy alloy design problems against non-adaptive baselines.

keywords:
  - Bayesian optimization
  - multi-objective optimization
  - large language models
  - materials design
  - high-entropy alloys
